  "solution": "**Given : **\n\nAmount = Rs. 27720\n\nTime = 7 years\n\nRate = 14%\n\n**Formula Used : **\n\nSI = (P × R × T)/100\n\nA = P + SI\n\n**Calculation : **\n\n⇒ 27720 = P(1 + R14/100)\n\n⇒ 27720 = P(100 + 14 × 7/100)\n\n⇒ 27720 × 100 = P(100 + 98)\n\n⇒ 2772000 = P(198)\n\n⇒ P = 2772000/198 = 14000\n\n**∴ The correct answer is Rs.14000.**",
